<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113849" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσόνησ-ος</span></b> , ἡ, later
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερρόνησος</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερόνησος</span></b>  (q. v.), 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσόνᾱσος</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			709.52
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέρνασος</span></b>  (q. v.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>peninsula,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.97
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.2.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>island with a bridge to it,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.24.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as pr. n.,
			of various peninsulas, esp. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>the Chersonese,</i> i.e. the peninsula of Thrace that runs
			along the Hellespont, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> the
				<i>Tauric Chersonese</i> or <i>Crimea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.99
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> the
			peninsula between Epidaurus and Troezen, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.42
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
